                                                "example_id": "83bc38cf-8584-4d97-a654-a74a20b8dbda",
                                                "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                                "text": "Every plan and every activity has an “oops.” Oops, we forgot to..., oops, who was supposed to do that? We all have experienced “oopses”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b29c08c-0228-441a-b567-ae35f714a80d",
                                                "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                                "text": "Isn't she the same woman who works at Wings that you and Billy almost got arrested for helping her with her last little oops?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a43234b-4769-4a2d-8ab5-68aedfb9e1ac",
                                                "sense_id": "86060d1b-60ed-3116-be38-7a70154260ba",
                                                "text": "My parents had moved to this house, which sat on the border of Corktown and Mexicantown, from their tiny apartment in Ann Arbor—once they found out that their little oops was actually two little oops."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
